{
 "encounter_id": "00804",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE",
  "person_4": "UNKNOWN"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Mr Brennan? I'm Aileen, the nurse. You said your home pulse oximeter was reading low."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's right. I've a wee gadget at home, and it said 88, on Monday, and I nearly dropped dead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning. Come in. Which number is low, and when?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "88 percent, then 90, 89. It was the same morning and evening, for three days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "His oxygen today is 93 on our machine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "[from the corridor] It said 87 on Tuesday, I saw it!"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll go by what you tell me, Mr Brennan. How have you been feeling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit breathless on the hill, and a cough. A dry one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Since when?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since the cold, three weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or sweats?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling in your legs, or waking at night breathless?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A small white tablet for the water, I couldn't tell you the name, from the heart clinic. And a blood-thinner, 5 mg, maybe? Twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll check with the record, the white one and the dose of the blood-thinner. Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hernia repair, in 2010."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your family history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father died of emphysema. He smoked like a chimney."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Aileen, can we do his observations on our machine, and walk him down the corridor with it on? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Of course.",
   "pause": 30.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. His oxygen was fine at rest, and it dropped a little with walking, then came back up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Those home devices can be inaccurate, especially with cold hands or nail varnish, but your breathlessness and cough deserve checking. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd say this might be a lingering chest infection, and I'm going to start you on an antibiotic, doxycycline, 100 mg twice a day, for a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like you to have an inhaler, salbutamol, two puffs when you're short of breath."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please come back in a week, and I'll check your chest again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll give you the leaflets. ~"
  }
 ],
